{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/3743368118178d2492ea7a2608be00f7.poster.avif?t=1773306020\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/3743368118178d2492ea7a2608be00f7.webm?t=1773306020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/3743368118178d2492ea7a2608be00f7.mp4?t=1773306020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When your 9 -5 job becomes a nightmare!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a surreal experience that fuses  roguelike with soulslike elements, where every workday is a battle for survival. Play as Alex, a recent graduate desperate to escape unemployment, who finally secures a position at a powerful tech corporation after months of tireless applications. But on his first day, he's dragged into a dark alternate reality, where the office twists into a nightmarish labyrinth and its workers have become mindless drones, enslaved by the company\u2019s unseen agenda.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/57eca6e3190cbf1dce1c5e18994ced9b.poster.avif?t=1773306020\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/57eca6e3190cbf1dce1c5e18994ced9b.webm?t=1773306020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/57eca6e3190cbf1dce1c5e18994ced9b.mp4?t=1773306020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Back with Your Mind and Reflexes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, Alex must battle through ever-shifting levels in fast-paced, stamina-free combat. Dodge, parry, and counter in real time while strategically balancing healing, defense, and special abilities with your blue sanity bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/470692b02e660d3579125feee0b96118.poster.avif?t=1773306020\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/470692b02e660d3579125feee0b96118.webm?t=1773306020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/470692b02e660d3579125feee0b96118.mp4?t=1773306020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot the Office, Upgrade Your Sanity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour office rooms filled with rare weapon and upgrades that  enhance your combat style. Discover unpredictable shop offering, stat boosts, and consumables to help you adapt to each floor\u2019s evolving threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/9b7d44c93efd38a5d03a93ee0ba344b7.poster.avif?t=1773306020\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/9b7d44c93efd38a5d03a93ee0ba344b7.webm?t=1773306020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/9b7d44c93efd38a5d03a93ee0ba344b7.mp4?t=1773306020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Bosses of Corporate Madness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level ends with a grotesque boss fight, filled with toxic working hatred relationship. Learn their patterns, overcome their mechanics, and expose the secrets buried deep within the company\u2019s corrupted core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/6fc58b1fab314ac3ae3c691c209f0841.poster.avif?t=1773306020\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/6fc58b1fab314ac3ae3c691c209f0841.webm?t=1773306020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/6fc58b1fab314ac3ae3c691c209f0841.mp4?t=1773306020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beat the Clock, Break the Cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware at 1700, you can't respawn anymore. Upon death after 1700, the office reboots, the layout changes, and the nightmare begins again at 0900. Can Alex break the loop and uncover the truth, or will he be stuck in the system forever?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638650?t=1773306020","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638650?t=1773306020","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/15e94244caacfeef98cd7cdeae439a62ef9fa67a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773306020","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/15e94244caacfeef98cd7cdeae439a62ef9fa67a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773306020","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":